#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.cuttlefish.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Cuttlefish"
msgstr "Cuttlefish"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.cuttlefish.appdata.xml:11
msgid "Icon Previewer for Artists and Developers"
msgstr "Previsualizador d'iconos p'artistes y desendolcadores"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.cuttlefish.appdata.xml:13
msgid ""
"Cuttlefish allows artists and developers to preview and pick icons."
" Cuttlefish attempts to render the icons exactly as they would look drawn in"
" the application. It allows to filter based on category and name. Cuttlefish"
" is not a general-purpose tool, but geared towards artists' and developers'"
" use-cases. Cuttlefish also provides a plugin for Kate and KDevelop to be"
" used as icon picker."
msgstr ""
"Cuttlefish permite a los artistes y los desendolcadores previsualizar y"
" escoyer iconos. L'aplicación tenta de renderizar los iconos exautaamente"
" como se veríen dibuxaes na aplicación. Permite peñerar según la estaya y el"
" nome. Cuttlefish nun ye una ferramienta pa usuarios, sinón enfocada a"
" artistes y desendolcadores. Tamién apurre un plugin pa Kate y KDevelop pa"
" usase como seleutor d'iconos."
